    "field_4": "THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE",
    "field_5": "About me",
    "text_17": "I'm a final-year Computer Science student at the University of Information Technology, Yangon, specializing in Knowledge Engineering. My interests span artificial intelligence, model training, and computer vision.",
    "text_18": "With hands-on experience in Java SE, Java EE, and PHP, I build practical solutions that help businesses improve their operations. AI is my main direction; cloud computing is my next step toward training and deploying models with larger computing resources.",
    "text_19": "I earned second runner-up in the KBZPay Mini App Development Competition, maintain a strong academic record, and passed the FE Examination. Beyond code, I have intermediate English proficiency, have passed JLPT N4 and N3, and am studying toward N2.",
    "text_20": "More about my journey",
