    "field_8": "My research",
    "text_23": "ICAIT 2026 · Upcoming presentation",
    "text_24": "RESEARCH PAPER / 2026",
    "text_25": "Language-Conditioned Abstention in Burmese-English RAG: Retrieval–Decision Divergence Across Query Languages",
    "text_26": "Han Nyi Min Htut",
    "text_27": "&",
    "text_28": " Thet Thet Zin",
    "text_29": "A controlled evaluation of when a local RAG system answers or abstains across English, Burmese, and code-mixed queries about university regulations.",
    "text_30": "Across 79 paired semantic intents and 237 query variants (222 held-out), the study separates retrieval quality from answer-versus-abstain decisions and output-contract compliance.",
